Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:05.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,September's award season produced the\Nclip that tells the whole story At an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:09.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,international music awards show in\NHong Kong Ahyeon walked up for a group
